{"id":17570,"path":"/listening/b1/plastic-roads-listening-test/","parentId":1142,"order":940,"section":"listening","level":"b1","depth":3,"title":"Roads made of plastic waste – B1 English Listening Test","seo":{"title":"Roads made of plastic waste – B1 English Listening Test - Test-English","description":"Listening comprehension test for intermediate students (CEFR B1). Watch a video about recycling and choose the correct answers.","image":"/media/uploads/B1-Listening_Plastic-roads.jpg"},"modified":"2025-06-05T14:27:01","kind":"lesson","parts":["<h3>B1 English Listening Test</h3> <h5>Watch a video about recycling, and for questions 1 to 6, choose the correct answer.</h5> <p></p> <div class=\"videoWrapper\"> <div data-youtube=\"XwPeKkpkK1s\"></div> </div> <h6>See the full list of <a href=\"/test-english.com/listening/b1/\">B1+ listening tests</a></h6> <div class=\"list-separator-dots\"><span>Questions</span></div> <div data-quiz=\"649\"></div>"],"explanation":null,"quizzes":[{"id":649,"questions":[{"id":5580,"num":"1","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>The A68 is a road that...</div>","choices":[{"id":8789,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>looks very similar to the other roads. </span>"},{"id":8790,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>is made with traditional asphalt. </span>"},{"id":8791,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>had a lot of construction problems. </span>"}]},{"id":5581,"num":"2","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>The plastic material used to make the road...</div>","choices":[{"id":8792,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>comes entirely from bottles.</span>"},{"id":8793,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>is easy to recycle. </span>"},{"id":8794,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>cannot be easily recycled. </span>"}]},{"id":5582,"num":"3","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>In this region,...</div>","choices":[{"id":8795,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>there are a few places that make plastic for roads.</span>"},{"id":8796,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>there is only one place that makes plastic for roads.</span>"},{"id":8797,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>there are many roads made using plastic waste. </span>"}]},{"id":5583,"num":"4","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Regarding quality, they think that plastic asphalt is...</div>","choices":[{"id":8798,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>better than traditional asphalt. </span>"},{"id":8799,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>as good as traditional asphalt. </span>"},{"id":8800,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>worse than traditional asphalt. </span>"}]},{"id":5584,"num":"5","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>For a part of the A689 road, they used...</div>","choices":[{"id":8801,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>60,000 shopping bags.</span>"},{"id":8802,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>6 tons of plastic.</span>"},{"id":8803,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>6,5 tons of plastic.</span>"}]},{"id":5585,"num":"6","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>In the UK, we...</div>","choices":[{"id":8804,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>recycle about 50% of the plastic.</span>"},{"id":8805,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>recycle less plastic than other countries. </span>"},{"id":8806,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>bring recycled plastic from other countries.</span>"}]}]}]}